{"game": "arc-raiders", "language": "english", "appid": 1808500, "month": "2026-06", "window": 1, "start_date": 1780272000, "end_date": 1780876799, "month_true_total": 4068, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 21:19:05 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "227451392", "author": {"steamid": "76561198803464849", "personaname": "Will8635", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198803464849/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 750, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 750, "last_played": 1778338656, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm not sure how I'm supposed to have fun with this game. The art is nice and it plays well. I just don't like spending all my time collecting garbage. You get no good loot whatsoever (at least in the time I've played). All you get is trash and hopefully can build a workbench to eventually build something decent. Then you will run into an unkillable arc and lose everything. Guns that are labelled as being \"strong\" against arc armor don't do ♥♥♥♥. Some of the arcs can take 50+ rounds from a ferro and not die.  This isn't fun.", "timestamp_created": 1780876527, "timestamp_updated": 1780876527, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48245614767074585", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227451013", "author": {"steamid": "76561199883943064", "personaname": "vexlsle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199883943064/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 652, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 422, "last_played": 1781388124, "avatar": "9f967b87cdef42b70a1972c4f702976afa6057e8"}, "language": "english", "review": "i found gun blueprints before a sheild recharger, felt like a poor kid in iraq", "timestamp_created": 1780876064, "timestamp_updated": 1780876064, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "227450727", "author": {"steamid": "76561199084061656", "personaname": "DanniiGrl03", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199084061656/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 30431, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30431, "last_played": 1780874717, "avatar": "2b436e404a9a1312eac34d2f121db0fd03199f6a"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game was amazing when it first came out. But now it has become cheater city! And it doesn't seem like the Devs really care much about it. The idea of the aggression match making was the most attractive part. As a casual player who has no interest spending hours on an aim trainer, it was nice not having to PvP a bunch of chads. But lately it seems that the matchmaking (the game's prize feature) is all over the place. The devs say that it's not based on this and that but the evidence seems to contradict them. \r\n\r\nA game where you spend literally hours grinding just to lose it all in 5 seconds to a cheater is just not going to keep players there.", "timestamp_created": 1780875700, "timestamp_updated": 1780875700, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid":